    "note": "Set AZURE_OPENAI_ENDPOINT to the resource URL (https://YOUR-RESOURCE.openai.azure.com); the /openai/v1 suffix is added for you. A model ID here is a deployment name chosen by whoever created the resource, not an OpenAI model ID. Which API versions a resource serves depends on its region."
  },
